{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-93fa8ff34a6d2d29c9a9","statement":"<<cite:MR1301623>> Set $a=q_i^2\\gamma^{1/2}$, $b=q_i^2\\gamma^{-1/2}$, $c=-q_i^{a_{ij}}\\gamma^{1/2}$, $d=-q_i^{a_{ij}}\\gamma^{-1/2}$ for $i\\neq j$, $r>0$, $m\\in\\mathbb Z$. Then\n\n\\begin{align*}\n[\\psi_{ir},x_{im}^-]&=-\\gamma^{1/2}[2]_i\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{r-1}a^{k-1}(q_i-q_i^{-1})\\psi_{i,r-k}x_{i,m+k}^-+a^{r-1}x_{i,m+r}^-\\right)  \\\\\n[\\psi_{ir},x_{im}^+]&=\\gamma^{-1/2}[2]_i\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{r-1}b^{k-1}(q_i-q_i^{-1})x_{i,m+k}^+\\psi_{i,r-k}+b^{r-1}x_{i,m+r}^+\\right)  \\\\\n[\\psi_{ir},x_{jm}^-]&=\\gamma^{1/2}[a_{ij}]_i\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{r-1}c^{k-1}(q_i-q_i^{-1})\\psi_{i,r-k}x_{j,m+k}^-+a^{r-1}x_{j,m+r}^-\\right)   \\\\\n[\\psi_{ir},x_{jm}^+]&=-\\gamma^{-1/2}[a_{ij}]_i\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{r-1}d^{k-1}(q_i-q_i^{-1})x_{j,m+k}^+\\psi_{i,r-k}+d^{r-1}x_{j,m+r}^+\\right) .\n\\end{align*}","source_id":"arXiv:1307.2941","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"5b92b3ee4fb19aafd099204084275b8a3b730ce32f766fcac3f2b20107dfdcc2","kind":"lemma","label":"Lemma 2","ref_key":"psix2","name":"","order":4,"deps":[],"cite_keys":["MR1301623"],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1307.2941","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"ae7ce84c74c6f2d8eae9ef43a41d25c64544d49600dc26f66cc16f2444b8f77c","line":807,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:11:44+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v3","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":761,"math_hints":127}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:1307.2941","title":"An imaginary PBW basis for quantum affine algebras of type 1","abstract":"Let $\\hat{\\mathfrak g}$ be an affine Lie algebra of type 1. We give a PBW basis for the quantum affine algebra $U_q(\\hat{\\mathfrak g})$ with respect to the triangular decomposition of $\\hat{\\mathfrak g}$ associated with the imaginary positive root system.","authors":["Ben Cox","Vyacheslav F